  "solution": "Đặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (km) (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>), khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tThời gian để đoàn cữu trợ đi từ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> (giờ).<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/c1f0594a6a4c13527200e0af022a28f3e36b4d0a37e35706068861770e15b9f1.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTừ bảng biến thiên suy ra thời gian đi nhanh nhất đến xã <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> giờ, khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tKhi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> km.",
